 "tableLines": [
  {
   "day": 17,
   "line": "✨ Ability gained: Fusion Reactor (L1). The System installs your fusion pellet — properly, inside you. You never need to eat again: the pellet covers your metabolism, and your strikes and abilities burn with a steady reactor fire (1.25x, always on). One reactor per world, and it never comes out: not unslotted, not un-taught, not surrendered. Death is the only uninstall. But the hunger is gone, and "
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "line": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Amara speaks at Emberhold's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "line": "💔 A faction of Emberhold has turned cannibal — and split. The eaters walked. The Red Table is a new fire in the world now — 2 people under Maya."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "line": "📓 Codex: Emberhold split (cannibal). The Red Table formed; 2 petition at Haven's fire."
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "line": "🧳 Emberhold has split — the eaters walked. They call the new fire The Red Table. Half of them were headed this way, or so the traveler says."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "line": "Word later: they walked to The Red Table. Another fire in the world, whether you wanted it or not."
  },
  {
   "day": 29,
   "line": "◈ FLASHBACK — Isabella's Drawing\nKitchen table, burnt pancakes. You told her the sun needed holding, and she took you literally — drew you carrying it with both hands. She was six. The sky changed three weeks later."
